<title>QATAR: Doha Bank Ltd 1996 profit rises slightly.</title>
<headline>Doha Bank Ltd 1996 profit rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				     (million riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		     34.83     vs	 34.43</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses  46.99     vs	 21.55</p>
<p> Proposed cash dividend     17.32     vs	 19.68</p>
<p> Total Assets		   3,771.02  vs	 3,389.86</p>
<p> Shareholders equity	  298.82    vs	 282.23</p>
<p>Full name: Doha Bank Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE: The bank's board of directors recommended a 22 percent cash dividend. But the annual general meeting of shareholders has adopted a resolution to increase the amount to 35 percent of the capital. The resolution is subject to Central Bank approval, which analysts said was unlikely to come through in view of the bank's higher customer deposit liabilities and loan risk provisions.</p>
</text>
